msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/ST/ST_KAB0233.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0233.BIN::line:297_2_5"
msgid "Come back and see me when ya decide you're||{MS:0}ready to take on a life of pro golfin'!{PA:20}"
